But in the moment, they seem real,
or better yet, even better than real!

20:28.853 --> 20:32.106
You must have experienced
the magic at some point, right?

20:32.190 --> 20:34.484
So why become a real murderer?

20:34.567 --> 20:35.818
You wanna know why?

20:35.902 --> 20:37.946
My back cracked
from carrying all those dead weights.

20:38.029 --> 20:39.948
Fuck those end-stage girls.

20:40.031 --> 20:42.158
I walk my own path.
Now I'm the main character.

20:42.241 --> 20:44.786
Now I am the serial killer!

20:44.869 --> 20:46.704
But why only target blonde bitches?

20:46.788 --> 20:49.958
Serial killers always
go for the blonde bitches first.

20:50.041 --> 20:51.709
That's the first premise of horror films.

20:51.793 --> 20:53.836
- She's crazy.
- Grandma, I expected better from you!

20:53.920 --> 20:55.838
Shut your pie hole, angel bitch.

20:55.922 --> 21:00.426
Well, if it isn't shit-for-brains.
You finally ready to bring your A-game?

21:00.510 --> 21:01.970
Then fuck these guys u--

21:05.473 --> 21:06.474
<i>Bitch.</i>

21:17.068 --> 21:18.361
Hey, Geek Boy.

21:26.327 --> 21:29.288
I see...
So this really made you happy, huh?

21:31.374 --> 21:33.626
<i>And thus, the case was closed.</i>

21:37.714 --> 21:40.591
<i>She's the Final Girl of this story.</i>

21:40.675 --> 21:42.343
This'll be hell to clean.

21:42.427 --> 21:45.054
<i>The monster became the hero,</i>

21:45.138 --> 21:50.268
<i>while the former heroine of horror fell
from grace and became a monster herself.</i>

21:50.351 --> 21:54.897
<i>Or perhaps it was us, the horror fans,
who propelled her descent into madness.</i>

21:55.523 --> 22:00.028
<i>Just who came up with the theory that the
blonde bitch is always the first to go?</i>

22:01.112 --> 22:04.115
<i>Just who is the real
monster in all of this?</i>

23:37.834 --> 23:39.836
Subtitle: Rychelle Brittain
